@startuml
[*] --> ViewingProjects
ViewingProjects --> SelectingProject : select project
SelectingProject --> ManagingProfiles : manage profiles
ManagingProfiles --> EditingProfile : edit profile
EditingProfile --> SavingChanges : save changes
SavingChanges --> ManagingProfiles : return to managing profiles
ManagingProfiles --> DeletingProfile : delete profile
DeletingProfile --> ManagingProfiles : return to managing profiles
ManagingProfiles --> AddingProfile : add profile
AddingProfile --> ManagingProfiles : return to managing profiles
ManagingProfiles --> SwitchingProjects : switch project
SwitchingProjects --> ViewingProjects : return to viewing projects
ManagingProfiles --> [*] : exit
@enduml
